OL,3,GNEWSAHomes evacuated as 'suspicious
OL,4,Adevices' found
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeveral homes have been evacuated after
OL,7,Fpolice found "a number of suspicious
OL,8,Fdevices" during a search operation in
OL,9,Fwest Belfast.
OL,11,FOfficers are at a house in Edwina
OL,12,FStreet, off the Shankill Road,
OL,13,Faccompanied by Army Ammunition
OL,14,FTechnical Officers (ATO).
OL,16,FEarlier on Friday, police said they
OL,17,Fwere searching two properties in the
OL,18,FShankill Road area as part of an
OL,19,Finvestigation into suspected terrorism
OL,20,Foffences.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
